      <link>https://gogaelsgo.com/news/2026/2/20/volleyball-w-queens-womens-volleyball-take-down-gryphons-in-three-sets-to-advance-to-oua-semifinals.aspx</link>
      <description>Queen's Women's Volleyball are heading to the OUA semifinals after a big 3-0 (25-11, 25-17, 25-14) win over the Guelph Gryphons in their quarterfinals matchup Friday night at the Athletics and Recreation Centre (ARC).</description>
