    <item>
      <title>Queen's Men's Volleyball tops York Lions in straight sets to advance to OUA semifinals</title>
      <link>https://gogaelsgo.com/news/2026/2/20/volleyball-m-queens-mens-volleyball-tops-york-lions-in-straight-sets-to-advance-to-oua-semifinals.aspx</link>
      <description>Queen's Men's Volleyball topped the visiting York Lions in straight sets, 3-0 (25-21, 26-24, 25-23) Friday night in their OUA quarterfinals matchup at the Athletics and Recreation Centre (ARC). With the victory, the Gaels, who entered the OUA Playoffs as the No. 3 seed, advanced to the semifinals.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://gogaelsgo.com/news/2026/2/20/volleyball-m-queens-mens-volleyball-tops-york-lions-in-straight-sets-to-advance-to-oua-semifinals.aspx</guid>
